              "rationale": "Service with fear becomes worship expressed through an added adoring embrace.",
              "text": "Worship God in adoring embrace,"
            },
            {
              "anchors": [
                {
                  "token_ids": [
                    "ps002.v011.t005",
                    "ps002.v011.t006"
                  ],
                  "unit_id": "ps002.v011.a"
